{"id":"218c13faf9022f13","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-cl-reduction.md","title":"完整线性膨胀 CL 归约","display":"df-cl-reduction — 完整线性膨胀 CL 归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-cl-reduction","aliases":["28-df-cl-reduction"],"display":"df-cl-reduction — 完整线性膨胀 CL 归约","depends_on":["[[28-df-csp-instance]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 22.3","source_printed_pages":"462","source_pdf_pages":"488","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-cl-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-cl-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cl-reduction — 完整线性膨胀 CL 归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b9a9d2bf0a32514c\" href=\"?note=b9a9d2bf0a32514c\" title=\"28-df-csp-instance\">28-df-csp-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 22.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"462"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"488"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W},\\operatorname{val},m\">\\(\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W},\\operatorname{val},m\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b9a9d2bf0a32514c\" href=\"?note=b9a9d2bf0a32514c\" title=\"28-df-csp-instance\">28-df-csp-instance</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\bigcup_{q,W\\ge1}\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\bigcup_{q,W\\ge1}\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}\\)</span> 采用该文件给出的具体编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\Phi\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\Phi\\rangle\\)</span> 的含义由下式固定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\Phi\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(\\Phi)\\qquad(\\Phi\\in\\mathcal C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle\\Phi\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(\\Phi)\\qquad(\\Phi\\in\\mathcal C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{CL}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;[\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathcal C\\quad f(\\langle\\Phi\\rangle)=\\langle F(\\Phi)\\rangle]\\\\\n&amp;\\land[\\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathcal C\\quad(\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{val}(F(\\Phi))=1)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land[\\forall q,W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists C,q&#39;,W&#39;\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}\\quad(F(\\Phi)\\in\\mathsf{CSP}_{q&#39;,W&#39;}\\land m(F(\\Phi))\\le C\\,m(\\Phi))].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{CL}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;[\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathcal C\\quad f(\\langle\\Phi\\rangle)=\\langle F(\\Phi)\\rangle]\\\\\n&amp;\\land[\\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathcal C\\quad(\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{val}(F(\\Phi))=1)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land[\\forall q,W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists C,q&#39;,W&#39;\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}\\quad(F(\\Phi)\\in\\mathsf{CSP}_{q&#39;,W&#39;}\\land m(F(\\Phi))\\le C\\,m(\\Phi))].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>C、输出元数及字母表只依赖输入的固定元数/字母表，不依赖变量和约束数。CL 只要求完整性与线性膨胀，本身不含可靠性或 gap 放大保证；那些必须由具体引理另给。本书定义允许固定常数参数决定归约族，此处写单个 F 的统一版本。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 22.3；印刷页 462；PDF 页 488。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-csp-instance","status":"resolved","id":"b9a9d2bf0a32514c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-csp-instance","status":"resolved","id":"b9a9d2bf0a32514c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W},\\operatorname{val},m$ 见 [[28-df-csp-instance]]；$\\mathcal C=\\bigcup_{q,W\\ge1}\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}$，$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}$ 采用该文件给出的具体编码；$\\langle\\Phi\\rangle$ 的含义由下式固定；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W},\\operatorname{val},m$ 见 [[28-df-csp-instance]]；$\\mathcal C=\\bigcup_{q,W\\ge1}\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}$，$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}$ 采用该文件给出的具体编码；$\\langle\\Phi\\rangle$ 的含义由下式固定；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W},\\operatorname{val},m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\bigcup_{q,W\\ge1}\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\Phi\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\Phi\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{CSP}}(\\Phi)\\qquad(\\Phi\\in\\mathcal C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{CL}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&[\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathcal C\\quad f(\\langle\\Phi\\rangle)=\\langle F(\\Phi)\\rangle]\\\\\n&\\land[\\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathcal C\\quad(\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{val}(F(\\Phi))=1)]\\\\\n&\\land[\\forall q,W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists C,q',W'\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall\\Phi\\in\\mathsf{CSP}_{q,W}\\quad(F(\\Phi)\\in\\mathsf{CSP}_{q',W'}\\land m(F(\\Phi))\\le C\\,m(\\Phi))].\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1982,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-397","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp]]。"}],"outgoing":["b9a9d2bf0a32514c","adb92775ec020a0b"]}